    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18816" root="سبل" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبِلٌ</span></b>  [is app. a possessive epithet, meaning
<i>Having length and flaccidity</i>]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُصْيَةٌ سَبِلَةٌ</span> means
[<i>A scrotum</i>] <i>that is long</i> (M, K, TA) <i>and flaccid.</i>
(TA.)

